    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1286">

                <pb facs="1091" n="987" xml:id="pg987"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1216 M/345.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs heartily approves letting Colorado River
                    question remain in statu quo pending negotiations of projected arrangement. He
                    will urge the Minister of Fomento to refrain from taking action on alleged new
                    concession.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
